WEBVTT

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:38.990
Young lady, you're here sightseeing, right?

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:41.450
London's gotten dangerous recently.

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:44.120
Do take care, particularly on foggy days.

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:48.210
There are all these rumors about a phantom slasher.

00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:51.850
I'd definitely like to meet a famous person like that.

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:57.260
Has it been three years?

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:00.760
I wonder how she'll react when I make a surprise visit.

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:22.120
This is an interesting place to live...

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:26.120
Mikamo-san?

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:43.350
That was weird.

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.020
Sumimasen!

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:52.020
Sore o hirotte kudasai!

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:00.280
Arigatou!

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:02.910
Tome-san, long time no see.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:05.860
It's me!

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:11.880
Wow, Miss Shunka!  Good job finding the house!

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:22.010
Ah, I was one street off.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:28.310
The young mistress has already gone to school.

00:03:28.810 --> 00:03:32.520
Considering it's her, I bet she keeps to herself even here, doesn't she?

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:40.190
If you're concerned, would you like to go out sightseeing until dinnertime and check out her school on the way?

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:43.400
Miss Mikamo's friend?

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:44.820
You?

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:47.700
I was her best friend in Japan.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:51.460
Her class is in the middle of gym period now.

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.540
What kind of attitude is that?

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:57.090
I wonder if Mikamo-san is all right.

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:05.010
Keep it up!

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:06.550
Don't go losing to William!

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:17.110
Amazing!

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.650
Awesome, she really won!

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:19.570
Cool!

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.150
You were great!

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:23.650
Awesome job beating William!

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.370
That was cool, Chiko!

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:28.410
I was impressed!

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:32.630
Koito-san!

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:38.420
I'm happy you still remember me.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:41.420
I'd never forget my friends' faces.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:43.260
Still, that was unexpected...

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.340
...seeing you laughing like that.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:50.100
Well, it's fun to learn new things.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:52.930
Then, are you having fun with love during your studies also?

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:54.600
Nothing like that...

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:56.560
Slow to mature as ever, eh?

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:00.940
What about you, Koito-san?  Didn't you say you'd marry when you turned sixteen?

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:03.110
Did I?

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:07.450
Leaving that aside, there are stories about a phantom killer loose in the city.  How about it?

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:08.950
About what?

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:11.370
Have you found any clues yet?

00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:13.160
Why would I do that?

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:15.080
"Why?"

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:16.960
Are you really Mikamo-san?

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:18.920
Huh?  Of course I am!

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:21.670
You're saying funny things, Koito-san.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:26.970
All right, please enjoy a flavor of England.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:31.100
This is a kidney pie I learned from our neighbor, Mary-san.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.810
Wow, it looks delicious!

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:33.930
Thanks for the food.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:39.400
Tokyo sure has changed a lot.

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:43.320
Sure has.  They say the Olympics will be held there in a few years.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:46.610
They're rapidly building new houses and roads too.

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:50.320
Is everyone doing all right?

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.490
Everyone's the same as ever.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:06:00.000
These flowers were set here yesterday.  Therefore, you could not have seen the flowers the day before.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:06.380
Akechi-san became really popular solving one difficult case after another.

00:06:06.800 --> 00:06:09.350
Thanks to that, the "tanuki" has been in a bad mood.

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:12.550
Akine-san is at your house, Shunka-sama?

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:16.850
And yet he said in his letter that he was very busy running from case to case.

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:23.360
Ah, geez!  Why do I have to do stuff like this?

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:27.110
It turned out the only work my mother had was tracking down her cats.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:30.450
But it would be unexpectedly troublesome without him there.

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:32.680
Ya-ya, found you.

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:37.500
Ya-ya-ya, ouch!  Hey!

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.830
And also, your aunt.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:40.750
My aunt?

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:43.710
Please do your best for me from now on.

00:06:44.540 --> 00:06:46.010
I have high expectations for you.

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:51.720
The rumor is she hired a new lawyer who is even younger and more handsome.

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:53.220
Oh my.

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:54.720
I see.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:02.400
This is a new TV tower they're building.  They say it will be the tallest in the world.

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:05.320
That crater was completely filled in.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:08.900
When the new buildings along the street are completed, all traces of it will be gone.

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:15.200
Nobody talks about Twenty Faces anymore.

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:17.120
As if it was all made-up.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:22.160
Children think he was just some character in a story.

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:24.120
I see.

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.300
People are amazing, aren't they?

00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.930
They just move on with their lives.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:35.930
Isn't that how it is with you, Shunka-sama?

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:37.560
What about your fiancé?

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:42.440
Is it true you're embarrassed by his sending you passionate love letters every day?

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:44.890
You told her, didn't you?

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:46.400
Sorry.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:50.150
Shunka-sama, please be careful when you reply to those letters.

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:54.990
Even if he's your fiancé, you should sometimes be warm and sometimes be cold.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.160
Is that so?

00:07:56.660 --> 00:08:00.950
They say it's best for men and women to maintain a respectable distance.

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:06.050
So, that's why you and Akine-san are maintaining a respectable distance?

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:11.010
Yeah, aren't you and Akine-san exchanging letters?

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:15.300
Those are just me informing him occasionally about what's happening with you.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:16.930
Wow, exchanging letters!

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:18.430
A love that transcends the seas!

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:19.470
That's not true!

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:21.810
I just use those letters to tell him about recent events.

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:24.020
That's what's called "exchanging letters."

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:26.650
Mine aren't like your love letters, Shunka-sama.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:29.150
Oh, haven't we talked enough about me?

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:31.230
I'm sure it's nice for both of you.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:32.650
No it's not!

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:35.410
What about you?  Isn't there some good-looking guy at your school?

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:36.280
No!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:38.700
Young mistress, be honest!

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:46.710
Today was fun.

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:49.920
It's been a long time since I laughed so much.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:51.880
In that case, I'll stay with you forever.

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:55.760
If only that could be true, it'd be fun.

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:58.720
You don't intend to come back to Japan?

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:02.770
No, it's fun living here.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.390
I see.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:09.900
Your life is moving on too.

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:13.740
It must be, if it's making you laugh so much more.

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:15.240
Koito-san?

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:18.240
Good night.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:45.850
Sorry for the wait.

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:47.850
Take some, both of you.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:49.690
Thank you, Tome-san.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:52.770
Ah, so this is fish and chips, eh?

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:56.440
It's more lively here than I thought.

00:09:56.650 --> 00:09:58.240
That's because it's Sunday.

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:00.780
So, what shall we go see next?

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:03.950
I want to check out Sherlock Holmes' house on Baker Street.

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:10.830
A lost child?

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.620
He looks Japanese.

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:16.590
Young man, what's wrong?  Where are your father and mother?

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:18.590
They're not here.

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:20.260
Did you get lost?

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:24.640
So this is a "missing persons" case.

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:26.480
Hey you, what's your name?

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:28.480
Yoshio.

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:32.150
Hold on now, a man doesn't sob like that.

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:35.110
If you act like that, how will you find your father and mother?

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.780
It's all right.  You'll find them for sure.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:42.990
Really?

00:10:43.990 --> 00:10:44.530
Yep.

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:51.210
Well then, leave it to us, the Detective Girls.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:53.630
We'll start searching for your parents immediately.

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:56.090
Detective Girls?

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:12.150
Only that your father is wearing a gray suit and a blue hat...

00:11:12.230 --> 00:11:13.690
Those aren't enough clues.

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:17.780
They may not even be in this area anymore.

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:23.240
It'd be better if they were wearing something easier to spot, like a silk hat or a cloak.

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:31.410
It was a good idea to search while mobile, wasn't it?

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:36.040
But, Koito-san, if the fog gets any thicker, we won't be able to see anything.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.050
Don't worry, it's not that bad.

00:11:44.590 --> 00:11:47.310
I can't see anything in this dense fog!

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:51.770
It's all right.  Tome-san is going to the police.

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:56.360
Whenever I'm upset and not sure what to do...

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:59.900
I bring to mind the people who are important to me.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:04.530
Trust in yourself and keep moving on and someday you'll be smiling again.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.870
Thinking like that will bring you courage.

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:12.920
What's important is to watch, listen, and think for yourself, OK?

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:15.080
Yeah.

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:22.930
As if I'd give up the credit for this to the police.

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.840
That Koito-san.

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:31.730
What's this?  Found him!

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:38.900
It was definitely this corner.

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:01.190
It's all right.  I'm sure he's just up ahead.

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:08.170
There's nobody here.

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:10.440
It looks like I was wrong.

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:12.660
Well, let's head back.

00:13:21.270 --> 00:13:22.440
Everyone, get behind me.

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:33.290
So you've come forth, phantom slasher!

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:36.960
As the leader of the Detective Girls, I'll be your opponent.

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:38.920
C'mon, bring it on!

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:49.590
Run away!

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:27.260
"Watch...

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:29.130
...listen...

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:32.300
...and think for yourself."

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:37.230
Miss!

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:54.370
Now's our chance!

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.310
Young mistress!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.780
Huh?  Did something happen?

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:24.770
No.  It was nothing.

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:30.400
Set your minds at ease!  They say Yoshio's parents are at the police station.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:38.540
What a relief.

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:54.550
Heh, that technique's not working.

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:21.320
It seems punishment is in order.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:27.960
Thank you, Miss.

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:30.960
Same to you.  It was thanks to you that I survived.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.800
Um, thank you too, Miss.

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:41.980
I just did what the leader of the Detective Girls ought to do.

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:52.940
Hey, Mom...

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:55.070
I want to be a detective!

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:58.030
And apprentice with Akechi-san.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:03.370
That kid shows some promise, doesn't he?

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:06.670
He'd better follow my advice and become a detective.

00:17:08.330 --> 00:17:12.960
I bet he'll become a splendid detective and find himself a circle of reliable friends.

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:15.170
Just like you two.

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:18.180
That's right.

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:22.690
Because wherever we are, we'll always be the Detective Girls.

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:25.340
Of course!

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:29.980
After a long hiatus, the Detective Girls have completed a mission.

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:37.110
Don't you want to call out to her?

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:39.490
I just happened across her while doing my work.

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:42.620
She's already following a different path.

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:44.540
You're not being honest with yourself.

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:20.410
Koito-san, it's time for breakfast.

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:27.580
Sorry, I was planning to stay a little longer, but...

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:29.460
Koito-san?

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:34.090
After all, if I don't go back, those love letters will start piling up.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:37.010
There's no need to see me off.

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:39.470
I don't like somber events.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:42.260
See you.

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:47.770
Koito-san!

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:50.980
Soon enough I won't be Koito-san anymore.

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:56.820
But, after seeing you, I have the feeling I can keep on being myself.

00:18:56.980 --> 00:19:00.950
After all, you're still the Chiko I knew.

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:06.240
You have to come to my wedding, understand?

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:07.540
Sure.

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:10.960
Absolutely come, Chiko.

00:19:16.500 --> 00:19:20.010
Shunka-sama has become such a fine lady.

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:20.800
Yeah.

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:23.590
You were all aglow too, young mistress.

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:26.760
The most you've been since we came to England.

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:48.370
It's been a long time, everyone.

00:19:49.000 --> 00:19:51.290
Sorry for coming so infrequently.

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:55.840
I've made a decision.

00:19:56.630 --> 00:19:58.750
I'm thinking about trying to return to Japan.

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:04.260
But rest assured, Twenty Faces and all of you will always be part of me.

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:07.720
Therefore, I'm able to go anywhere.

00:20:08.260 --> 00:20:09.640
Something is about to begin.

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:11.600
That's just a hunch that I have.

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:25.740
Boss, are we heading back to the hideout?

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:27.780
No, there's one more thing.

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:31.330
I feel we should also obtain the Anastasia Ruby.

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:34.120
The Anastasia Ruby?

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:37.340
That's the gem that's associated
with tragic princesses.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:39.340
That has a lovely sound to it.

00:20:39.550 --> 00:20:43.220
I'd bet it's being worn by a beautiful young lady.

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:45.890
It's just something the Boss will steal from the pigs.

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:49.470
That'll make this our last job in Japan, huh.

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:51.810
Then we'll be saying farewell soon enough.

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:54.480
So, who's going?

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:57.980
I'll infiltrate the targeted mansion.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:00.230
I'll leave the cleanup to all of you.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:01.320
Yes sir!

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:05.750
Great!  We'll take care of
any police that try following us!

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:09.280
Ken, stop bragging!

00:21:11.990 --> 00:21:15.790
Boss, why this sudden interest in such a small ruby?

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:18.960
Well, you see.  There's something...

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:21.550
It seems something is about to begin.

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:24.090
That's just a hunch that I have.

00:22:09.810 --> 00:22:11.040
Mister!
